  _dialogueDistance: 5
  _isIntro: 0
  _manager: {fileID: 0}
  _dialogue:
    _sentences:
    - Thanks for doing this, I know it's been a long time. (Click To Continue)
    - He never had a will, so everything defaulted to us, and whatever doesn't get
      sold will just be dropped off at the nearest pawn shop anyways.
    - The auction wants pictures of anything you plan to sell. I think he had a digital
      camera if you want to find it.
    - I'd join you at the house, but... you know things were with him. You should
      give me a call once you've settled in a bit.
