      sold will just be dropped off at the nearest pawn shop anyways.
    - The auction wants pictures of everythng you plan to sell. I think he had a
      digital camera you could use...
    - 'I''d join you at the house, but you know things were with him... Call me again
      once you''ve settled in. '
